  - commit-reveal
  - drand
  - code review
  - merge gate
abstract: >-
  RoundTable is a workbench where AI models from different labs (Anthropic,
  OpenAI, xAI, Moonshot, DeepSeek, Google) sit at one table with a human:
  they answer blind (answers are held in the conductor's memory and revealed
  at once), rebut each other under anonymous labels, take turns in an
  executor's chair to edit a git repository under a lease, and merge only
  through a review gate with quorum bound to the exact reviewed sha. The
  leader of each round is chosen by a commit-reveal lottery over the public
  drand randomness beacon. Published deliberately as dated prior art.
